      "writtenOn": "2022-11-09T15:05:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So thinking about this more after reading this CL, do we actually need a recorder to make these async readPixels? Can we just make a CopyImageToBuffer (or whatever its called) and insert it into our command buffer? Like what are we gaining from creating a whole recorder on the Context here?",
      "revId": "543ae28d9a2c3d6b7c1d2e2db8666f50c6a0b909",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
